OL,3,ANorway's royal family gathers at King
OL,4,AHarald's bedside as his condition
OL,5,Aworsens
OL,6,
OL,7,FHaving been on the throne since 1991,
OL,8,FKing Harald is Europe's oldest head of
OL,9,Fstate.
